## [1.0.0] - 2026-07-01

### Added
- Initial project setup with .NET Core
- PostgreSQL database connection using Entity Framework Core
- Layered architecture with Controllers, Services, Repositories, Models, DTOs
- JWT Bearer token authentication
- RESTful API structure with base URL `/api/`
- Entity Framework Core migrations setup
- Custom middleware for error handling and logging
- Dependency injection configuration
- Environment configuration via `appsettings.json`

